{{en-verb}}

# To provide with pillars or added strength as if from pillars.
#* {{quote-book|en|title=Blast furnace practice|author=James Morgan|year=1910|passage=Insufficient penetration, or faulty distribution of the blast, may give rise to "'''pillaring'''" — that is, the formation of a pillar or column of cold material extending up through the middle of the hearth}}
